From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 14:21:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add network mode and CPU temperature tiles

Network mode lets the SIM used for mobile data use 5G, or keeps it on
4G. It sets the user allowed network types, the same ones as the
preferred network type in Settings, adds or drops only the NR bits and
always keeps LTE. Smart 5G uses its own reason, so it still applies on
top. The tile shows on phones whose modem supports NR, and a long press
opens the mobile network settings.

CPU temperature shows the hottest CPU the thermal HAL reports through
HardwarePropertiesManager, which SystemUI may read with DEVICE_POWER,
every two seconds while quick settings is open. It shows as unavailable
when there is no reading, and a long press opens the battery usage.

Both are legacy tiles registered in the existing connectivity and
battery modules, like the NFC tile, and are listed in the stock tiles
so they can be added from the tile editor.

Change-Id: I9c9fc501370a42b78fc0adffdec5e0043aa8da82
